# AI on Rails blog log

After work on this learning repo, update `blog/` before ending the turn. Notes for later posts. First person. What shipped, what broke, what rule or test changed.

One file per week goal from `docs/production-ai-engineering-12-week-plan.md`. Filename is `blog/ai-on-rails-<goal-slug>.md`. No date in the filename. No new file because the calendar day changed.

Until that week's end-of-week outcome is reached, append a `## YYYY-MM-DD` section to the current file. Start a new file only when the next week starts.

```markdown
# bad
blog/2026-09-04-day-02.md
blog/ai-on-rails-day-2.md
```

```markdown
# good (same week, next day)
# blog/ai-on-rails-generate-rails-saas-app.md
## 2026-09-04
```

```markdown
# good (week 2 starts)
blog/ai-on-rails-structured-case-summarization.md
```
